# Core

- Lit 3 + `nui-*` components under `src/components/`. Local imports use `.js` suffix.
- Checks: `npm run check` after code edits. One agent; Ask for Q&A.
- **Short chats** - one task per chat.
- **Narrow tools** - no `@` whole dirs, no monorepo/log/CI dumps.
- **Ask for Q&A** - `/ask` or Ask mode; Agent only when editing.
- **One agent** - no spare subagents; no parallel explore+implement+review unless asked.

